<title>AUSTRALIA: RTRS-New Cap shares rise strongly on debut.</title>
<headline>RTRS-New Cap shares rise strongly on debut.</headline>
<dateline>SYDNEY 1996-12-13</dateline>
<text>
<p>Shares in New Cap Reinsurance Corp Holdings Ltd debuted on the Australian Stock Exchange at A$2.70 on Friday, 17 cents above the offer price.</p>
<p>The reinsurance company raised A$15.8 million from its oversubscribed offer of six million shares at A$2.53 each.</p>
<p>It has a total of 81 million shares on issue, with the 20 largest shareholders holding 82.16 percent of the issued capital or 66.537 million shares.</p>
<p>New Cap shares were trading at A$2.69 at 1.20 p.m. (0220 GMT).</p>
<p>-- Sydney Newsroom 61-2 9373-1800</p>
